---
export const prerender = true
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service — MabEcare Foundation"
  description="Terms governing your use of the MabEcare Foundation website and donation platform."
>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="mb-12">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-foreground sm:text-4xl">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
        Last updated: September 15, 2026 &nbsp;|&nbsp; Applies to: mabecare-foundation.vercel.app
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-neutral max-w-none space-y-8 text-foreground">

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Agreement to Terms</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          By accessing or using the MabEcare Foundation website (the "Site"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use the Site.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Use of the Site</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          You agree to use the Site only for lawful purposes and in a way that does not infringe the rights of, restrict, or inhibit anyone else's use of the Site. You may not use the Site to transmit harmful, fraudulent, or unlawful content.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Donations</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          Donations made through this Site are processed via a third-party payment provider. By making a donation, you confirm that the payment details you provide are accurate and that you are authorised to use the payment method. All donations are voluntary and, except where required by law, are non-refundable.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          MabEcare Foundation uses donated funds to support its programmes for mothers and children in Ghana, in line with its stated mission. We reserve the right to allocate funds where they are needed most within the scope of our work.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">In-Kind Donations</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          For in-kind (item) donations submitted through the Site, you agree to provide accurate information about the items being donated. MabEcare Foundation reserves the right to determine the appropriate use or distribution of donated items.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          All content on this Site, including text, images, logos, and design, is the property of MabEcare Foundation or its licensors and is protected by applicable intellectual property laws. You may not reproduce, distribute, or use this content without our prior written permission.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          The Site may use third-party services for payment processing, email delivery, and analytics. Your use of these services through our Site is also subject to the respective third party's own terms and privacy policies.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          The Site is provided on an "as is" basis without warranties of any kind. MabEcare Foundation shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of the Site, to the fullest extent permitted by law.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Changes to These Terms</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          We may update these Terms of Service from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated "Last updated" date. Continued use of the Site after changes constitutes acceptance of the revised terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Governing Law</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          These Terms are governed by the laws of the Republic of Ghana, without regard to conflict of law principles.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Contact Us</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          If you have any questions about these Terms of Service, please contact us at
          <a href="mailto:mabecarefoundation@gmail.com" class="text-primary hover:underline">mabecarefoundation@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>